用适当方法求下列微分方程的通解：

(1) $y'-x^{2}y^{2}=y;$

(2) $3y^{2}y'-y^{3}=x+1;$

(3) $y' = \frac{1}{\mathrm{e}^y + x};$

(4) $(\cos y - 2x)' = 1$ ;

(5) $\frac{\mathrm{dy}}{\mathrm{dx}} = (x + y)^2$ ;

(6) $y' = \sin^2 (x - y + 1)$ ;

(7) $yy' - y^2 = x^2$ ; (8) $xy' + y = y(\ln x + \ln y)$ .  
(9) $\cos y\mathrm{d}x + (x - 2\cos y)\sin y\mathrm{d}y = 0$ ; (10) $(x^2 + y^2 + 2x)\mathrm{d}x + 2y\mathrm{d}y = 0$ .

